    dct:description "SHACL shapes for EU AI Act (Regulation (EU) 2024/1689) — obligation mapping: the constraints an instance must satisfy, published so any SHACL processor can check what the Foxxi validator checks (POST https://foxxi-bridge.interego.xwisee.com/ns/eu-ai-act/validate). Each validation result cites the shape it came from. An instance written as JSON is read into RDF through the JSON-LD context at https://foxxi-bridge.interego.xwisee.com/ns/eu-ai-act/context/2026.10.0."@en ;
